Traveler's Titles for Sunrise (version 0.5.0)

A port of Traveler's Titles 26.1.2 (6.1.0) by YUNG (YUNG-GANG).
Original source: https://github.com/YUNG-GANG/Travelers-Titles
Original licence: LGPL-3.0-only

Ported to Sunrise by arismoko: the title rules, rendering and commands are implemented in
Rust on Sunrise's typed mod API (no Java code is included).

Carried from the original under its licence: the language files (assets/travelerstitles/lang;
en_us.json has the Options → Mods labels and tooltips added), the sound events and their
three .ogg files (assets/travelerstitles/sounds*) and the `is_underground` biome tag
(data/travelerstitles/tags). The mod icon (icon.png) is the original's icon, resized.

This port is distributed under the same licence as the original (LGPL-3.0-only); the full
licence texts are in COPYING and COPYING.LESSER (the latter also as LICENSE).
